/Title (The seven scepters of the seven spirits of God Himself.There are the three branches  extending Left and three branches extending right with the center candle in the center. The lamp stand is the Light of the fullness of God in his three part presence and His  seven spirits. More than a physical lampstand, the menorah reflects how God reveals Himself to  humanity. It represents divine illumination, spiritual truth, and the way God meets man.)
